    "summary_one_sentence": "When a modern family moves to the countryside, their children discover an enchanted tree that leads to fantastical lands and helps restore their fading family bond.",
    "summary_short": "Relocating to the peaceful countryside, a modern family hopes for a fresh start away from their busy lives. The children soon discover a extraordinary, magical tree in the nearby woods inhabited by eccentric, whimsical characters. As the tree's uppermost branches open portals to ever-changing, fantastical realms, the children embark on incredible adventures. Through these shared extraordinary experiences, the family rediscover their connection and rekindle their love for one another.",
    "summary_long": "In an effort to reconnect and escape the hectic pace of modern life, a family relocates to a quiet countryside home. Exploring their new surroundings, the children wander into an enchanted forest where they stumble upon the legendary Magic Faraway Tree. The giant tree is home to a colorful array of eccentric, magical residents who warmly welcome the young newcomers. Most astonishingly, the very top of the tree serves as a portal to ever-shifting, fantastical lands that arrive above the clouds. Eager for adventure, the children climb through the doorway and find themselves transported into imaginative worlds full of wonder and unpredictable challenges. Each voyage forces the siblings to rely on their creativity, bravery, and teamwork to navigate the strange landscapes and return home safely. Along the way, their parents slowly begin to notice the remarkable changes in their children's spirit and imagination. As the magical journeys unfold, the family learns to slow down, listen to one another, and rediscover the joy of shared wonder. Ultimately, the magical tree provides more than just thrilling escapes—it gives the family the renewed unity and strength they desperately needed.",
